\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces PR-AUC comparison between published English-language results and the Persian medical results in this study. English results are taken from Shelmanov et al.~\cite  {b1}: Mistral 7B Instruct v0.2 on English biographies and seven English out-of-domain domains; Gemma 2 9B Instruct on its English biography test set; and Llama 3.1 8B Instruct on English biographies and seven English out-of-domain domains. For the Mistral and Llama out-of-domain groups, the bars show the arithmetic mean across the seven published English domains. No confidence intervals, error bars, or domain-range whiskers are displayed. Gaokerena-V and Gaokerena-R are evaluated on Persian medical data in the present study. This is a contextual cross-study comparison, not a controlled leaderboard, because languages, domains, datasets, annotation procedures, and test distributions differ.}}{8}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:results}{{3}{8}{}{figure.3}{}}
